// as a mask that reveals the fill like a brush writing it (1.2s, 1s after mount).
// `length` is the path length in viewBox units, used as the dash length so the
// reveal works in every engine (WebKit ignores pathLength for CSS dash arrays).
//
// The R is three strokes, in writing order: the loop (lead-in + bowl), the left
// stem (top hook running all the way down to the bottom-left), and the right leg.

